SNAKEDRIVER.

REGIMENTAL COMMAND HAS ORDERED THE FIELDING OF 3 FULL 
TROOPS. YOUR COLLECTIVE MISSION OBJECTIVE IS A FORWARD 
PUSH INTO NATO ADVISORY GROUP OCCUPIED TERRITORY. 

1ST TROOP IS ORDERED TO ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 174ø 
SOUTH BY SOUTHWEST. THIS WILL BRING 1ST TROOP INTO CONTACT 
WITH ENEMY ELEMENTS HOLDING CORRIDOR DELTA ROMEO-7. YOUR 
PRIMARY OBJECTIVE IS THE SANCTIONING OF ALL ENEMY ASSETS WITHIN 
THE AREA OF OPERATIONS.

2ND AND 3RD TROOPS ARE TO ASSUME COURSE HEADINGS OF 228ø SOUTH 
BY SOUTH WEST. YOUR PRIMARY MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO ESTABLISH 
CONTACT WITH AND ENGAGE FIELD COMMAND ASSETS FROM THE NATO 
FORCE'S ALPHA HQ. DESIGNATED TARGETS ARE TO INCLUDE BOTH ON LINE 
ARMOR AS WELL AS LOGISTICS/RESUPPLY ASSETS.

ENEMY FORCES HAVE ESTABLISHED FORWARD LINES OF DEFENSE THROUGH 
HEAVY MINEFIELD SATURATION. 
